msgid "Ordered Linked Lists"
msgstr "有序链表"

msgid "In an **ordered linked list**, the values are stored in **nondecreasing** order from the head to the tail. Unlike a stack or a queue, we can insert or remove a node anywhere in the list, as long as the list stays ordered. An ordered linked list provides:"
msgstr "在**有序链表**（ordered linked list）中，值从头到尾按**非递减**顺序存储。与栈和队列不同，我们可以在链表的任何位置插入或删除节点，只要链表保持有序即可。有序链表提供："

msgid "`dataExists(d)`: search for the value `d`."
msgstr "`dataExists(d)`：查找值 `d`。"

msgid "`insertData(d)`: insert a new node that stores `d`, at the position that keeps the list ordered."
msgstr "`insertData(d)`：在能保持链表有序的位置插入一个存储 `d` 的新节点。"

msgid "`deleteData(d)`: remove the first node that stores `d`."
msgstr "`deleteData(d)`：删除第一个存储 `d` 的节点。"

msgid "a copy constructor and a copy assignment operator."
msgstr "拷贝构造函数和拷贝赋值运算符。"

msgid "The `OrderedList` class"
msgstr "`OrderedList` 类"

msgid "Like a stack, an ordered linked list only needs a pointer to its first node, `head`. We use the `Node` class from the From Arrays to Linked Lists section."
msgstr "和栈一样，有序链表只需要一个指向第一个节点的指针 `head`。我们使用“从数组到链表”一节中的 `Node` 类。"

msgid "**Code in `OrderedList.h`**"
msgstr "**`OrderedList.h` 中的代码**"

msgid "**Line 6 and 7.** As in `Stack`, an empty list has `head` equal to `nullptr`, and the destructor frees all the nodes by deleting the first one."
msgstr "**第 6 和 7 行。** 和 `Stack` 一样，空链表的 `head` 等于 `nullptr`，析构函数通过删除第一个节点来释放所有节点。"

msgid "**Line 8.** `dataExists` does not change the list, so it is a `const` member function."
msgstr "**第 8 行。** `dataExists` 不会改变链表，所以它是一个 `const` 成员函数。"

msgid "**Line 11 and 12.** The class owns dynamically allocated nodes and has a destructor, so by the Rule of Three it also needs its own copy constructor and copy assignment operator. We implement them at the end of this section."
msgstr "**第 11 和 12 行。** 这个类拥有动态分配的节点，并且有析构函数，所以根据三法则（Rule of Three），它也需要自己的拷贝构造函数和拷贝赋值运算符。我们在本节最后实现它们。"

msgid "`dataExists`"
msgstr "`dataExists`"

msgid "**Line 2.** We start at the first node."
msgstr "**第 2 行。** 我们从第一个节点开始。"

msgid "**Line 3.** We keep walking while there is a node, and its value is not larger than `d`. Since the list is ordered, once we reach a value larger than `d`, every value after it is also larger than `d`, so we can stop early. Note that the order of the two conditions matters: `&&` evaluates `current != nullptr` first, so we never call `current->getData()` on `nullptr`."
msgstr "**第 3 行。** 只要还有节点，并且它的值不大于 `d`，我们就继续向后走。由于链表是有序的，一旦遇到一个大于 `d` 的值，它后面的每个值也都大于 `d`，所以我们可以提前停止。注意两个条件的顺序很重要：`&&` 会先求值 `current != nullptr`，所以我们永远不会对 `nullptr` 调用 `current->getData()`。"

msgid "**Line 4 to 6.** If the current node stores `d`, we found it."
msgstr "**第 4 到 6 行。** 如果当前节点存储的是 `d`，就找到了。"

msgid "**Line 9.** We reached the end of the list or a larger value, so `d` is not in the list."
msgstr "**第 9 行。** 我们到达了链表末尾或遇到了更大的值，所以 `d` 不在链表中。"

msgid "For example, searching for `3` in `[1, 3]` walks past `1` and returns `true` at the second node. Searching for `2` in `[1, 3]` walks past `1`, then stops at `3` because `3 <= 2` is false, and returns `false` without reaching the end of the list:"
msgstr "例如，在 `[1, 3]` 中查找 `3` 时，会走过 `1`，然后在第二个节点处返回 `true`。在 `[1, 3]` 中查找 `2` 时，会走过 `1`，然后因为 `3 <= 2` 为假而停在 `3`，不必走到链表末尾就返回 `false`："

msgid "If the list is empty, `current` starts as `nullptr`, so we skip the loop and return `false`."
msgstr "如果链表为空，`current` 一开始就是 `nullptr`，所以我们跳过循环并返回 `false`。"

msgid "Case"
msgstr "情况"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "Empty list"
msgstr "空链表"

msgid "Return `false` immediately"
msgstr "立即返回 `false`"

msgid "Target smaller than the head value"
msgstr "目标小于头节点的值"

msgid "Stop at the head; return `false`"
msgstr "停在头节点；返回 `false`"

msgid "Target equals the head value"
msgstr "目标等于头节点的值"

msgid "Return `true` immediately"
msgstr "立即返回 `true`"

msgid "Target larger than every value"
msgstr "目标大于所有值"

msgid "Visit every node; return `false`"
msgstr "访问每个节点；返回 `false`"

msgid "**Time complexity.** Let $n$ be the number of nodes. In the worst case, *e.g.* when the target is larger than every value, we visit all $n$ nodes, so `dataExists` is $O(n)$. In the best case, the list is empty or the head stores the target, so it is $O(1)$."
msgstr "**时间复杂度。** 设 $n$ 为节点数。在最坏情况下，*例如*目标大于所有值时，我们会访问全部 $n$ 个节点，所以 `dataExists` 是 $O(n)$ 的。在最好情况下，链表为空或头节点存储的就是目标，所以是 $O(1)$ 的。"

msgid "Why not binary search?"
msgstr "为什么不用二分查找？"

msgid "The values are sorted, and we saw in the Complexity Analysis chapter that binary search on a sorted array is $O(\\log n)$, which is better than the $O(n)$ of linear search. However, binary search needs to jump to the middle element. An array supports **random access**: `arr[i]` takes $O(1)$ time. A linked list does not: to reach the middle node, we have to follow $n/2$ `next` pointers from the head, which already takes $O(n)$ time. Therefore, binary search does not help on a linked list."
msgstr "这些值是有序的，而我们在复杂度分析一章中看到，在有序数组上进行二分查找是 $O(\\log n)$ 的，比线性查找的 $O(n)$ 更好。但是，二分查找需要跳到中间的元素。数组支持**随机访问**：`arr[i]` 只需 $O(1)$ 时间。链表不支持：要到达中间节点，我们必须从头节点开始沿着 $n/2$ 个 `next` 指针走，这本身就需要 $O(n)$ 时间。因此，二分查找对链表没有帮助。"

msgid "`insertData`"
msgstr "`insertData`"

msgid "To insert a node, we need to change the `next` of the node **before** the insertion position. Since a node only points to the node after it, we walk through the list with two pointers: `current`, and `previous`, which is always one node behind `current`."
msgstr "要插入一个节点，我们需要修改插入位置**之前**那个节点的 `next`。由于节点只指向它后面的节点，我们用两个指针遍历链表：`current`，以及始终比 `current` 落后一个节点的 `previous`。"

msgid "**Line 4 to 7.** We advance both pointers while the value of `current` is smaller than `d`. When the loop stops, the new node belongs between `previous` and `current`. Note that we use `<`, and not `<=`: if `d` is already in the list, we stop at the first node that stores `d`, so the new node is inserted **before** the first equal value."
msgstr "**第 4 到 7 行。** 只要 `current` 的值小于 `d`，我们就让两个指针都前进。循环停止时，新节点应该位于 `previous` 和 `current` 之间。注意我们用的是 `<` 而不是 `<=`：如果 `d` 已经在链表中，我们会停在第一个存储 `d` 的节点处，所以新节点被插入到第一个相等值的**前面**。"

msgid "**Line 8.** The new node stores `d`, and its `next` points to `current`. If `current` is `nullptr`, the new node becomes the last node."
msgstr "**第 8 行。** 新节点存储 `d`，它的 `next` 指向 `current`。如果 `current` 是 `nullptr`，新节点就成为最后一个节点。"

msgid "**Line 9 to 13.** If `previous` is `nullptr`, the loop did not advance, so the new node is the new first node and `head` must point to it. Otherwise, we link `previous` to the new node."
msgstr "**第 9 到 13 行。** 如果 `previous` 是 `nullptr`，说明循环没有前进过，所以新节点是新的第一个节点，`head` 必须指向它。否则，我们把 `previous` 链接到新节点。"

msgid "**What if the new value belongs before the head?** For example, to insert `2` into `[3]`, the loop is skipped because `3 < 2` is false, so `previous` is still `nullptr`. The new node points to the old first node, and `head` moves to the new node:"
msgstr "**如果新值应该放在头节点之前呢？** 例如，把 `2` 插入 `[3]` 时，因为 `3 < 2` 为假，循环被跳过，所以 `previous` 仍然是 `nullptr`。新节点指向原来的第一个节点，`head` 移到新节点："

msgid "**What if the list is empty?** Both `previous` and `current` are `nullptr`, so the new node's `next` is `nullptr`, and `head` points to it. The same code handles both cases."
msgstr "**如果链表为空呢？** `previous` 和 `current` 都是 `nullptr`，所以新节点的 `next` 是 `nullptr`，`head` 指向它。同一段代码可以处理这两种情况。"

msgid "`head` points to the new node; its `next` is `nullptr`"
msgstr "`head` 指向新节点；它的 `next` 是 `nullptr`"

msgid "Value smaller than the head value"
msgstr "值小于头节点的值"

msgid "Insert at the front and update `head`"
msgstr "插入到最前面并更新 `head`"

msgid "Value larger than every value"
msgstr "值大于所有值"

msgid "Append at the tail; the new node's `next` is `nullptr`"
msgstr "追加到尾部；新节点的 `next` 是 `nullptr`"

msgid "Duplicate value"
msgstr "重复的值"

msgid "Insert before the first equal value"
msgstr "插入到第一个相等值的前面"

msgid "**Time complexity.** In the worst case, *e.g.* when the new value is larger than every value, we walk through all $n$ nodes to find the insertion position, so `insertData` is $O(n)$. In the best case, the list is empty or the new value belongs before the head, so it is $O(1)$."
msgstr "**时间复杂度。** 在最坏情况下，*例如*新值大于所有值时，我们要走过全部 $n$ 个节点才能找到插入位置，所以 `insertData` 是 $O(n)$ 的。在最好情况下，链表为空或新值应该放在头节点之前，所以是 $O(1)$ 的。"

msgid "`deleteData`"
msgstr "`deleteData`"

msgid "**Line 2 to 7.** The same loop as in `insertData` stops at the first node whose value is not smaller than `d`, with `previous` one node behind."
msgstr "**第 2 到 7 行。** 与 `insertData` 中相同的循环会停在第一个值不小于 `d` 的节点处，`previous` 落后一个节点。"

msgid "**Line 8 to 10.** If we reached the end of the list, or the value of `current` is larger than `d`, then `d` is not in the list. We return `false` without changing any link."
msgstr "**第 8 到 10 行。** 如果我们到达了链表末尾，或者 `current` 的值大于 `d`，那么 `d` 不在链表中。我们返回 `false`，不修改任何链接。"

msgid "**Line 11 to 15.** We unlink `current`. If it is the first node, `head` moves to the second node. Otherwise, `previous` is linked to the node after `current`. If `current` is the last node, `current->getNext()` is `nullptr`, so `previous` becomes the new last node."
msgstr "**第 11 到 15 行。** 我们把 `current` 从链表中断开。如果它是第一个节点，`head` 移到第二个节点。否则，把 `previous` 链接到 `current` 之后的节点。如果 `current` 是最后一个节点，`current->getNext()` 是 `nullptr`，所以 `previous` 成为新的最后一个节点。"

msgid "**Line 16 and 17.** As in `pop` and `dequeue`, we must detach `current` before deleting it. Otherwise, the destructor of `Node` would also delete every node after it."
msgstr "**第 16 和 17 行。** 和 `pop` 与 `dequeue` 一样，我们必须在删除 `current` 之前把它分离出来。否则，`Node` 的析构函数还会删除它后面的每个节点。"

msgid "Return `false`"
msgstr "返回 `false`"

msgid "Target absent"
msgstr "目标不存在"

msgid "Return `false`; change no links"
msgstr "返回 `false`；不修改任何链接"

msgid "Remove the head"
msgstr "删除头节点"

msgid "Advance `head`"
msgstr "`head` 前进"

msgid "Remove the only node"
msgstr "删除唯一的节点"

msgid "`head` becomes `nullptr`"
msgstr "`head` 变为 `nullptr`"

msgid "Remove the tail"
msgstr "删除尾节点"

msgid "The predecessor's `next` becomes `nullptr`"
msgstr "前驱节点的 `next` 变为 `nullptr`"

msgid "Repeated equal values"
msgstr "有多个相等的值"

msgid "Remove only the first matching node"
msgstr "只删除第一个匹配的节点"

msgid "**Time complexity.** In the worst case, *e.g.* when the target is larger than every value, we walk through all $n$ nodes, so `deleteData` is $O(n)$. In the best case, the list is empty or the target is at the head, so it is $O(1)$."
msgstr "**时间复杂度。** 在最坏情况下，*例如*目标大于所有值时，我们会走过全部 $n$ 个节点，所以 `deleteData` 是 $O(n)$ 的。在最好情况下，链表为空或目标在头节点，所以是 $O(1)$ 的。"

msgid "Copy constructor"
msgstr "拷贝构造函数"

msgid "Recall from the Objects with Pointers chapter that the default copy constructor copies each data member. For `OrderedList`, it copies the pointer `head`, and not the nodes: a **shallow copy**. Both lists would share the same nodes, so when one list is destroyed, the other list's `head` becomes a dangling pointer, and the nodes would be deleted twice when the other list is destroyed."
msgstr "回忆“含指针的对象”一章：默认的拷贝构造函数会复制每个数据成员。对于 `OrderedList`，它复制的是指针 `head`，而不是节点：这是**浅拷贝**。两个链表会共享相同的节点，所以当一个链表被销毁时，另一个链表的 `head` 就成了悬空指针，而且当另一个链表被销毁时，这些节点会被删除第二次。"

msgid "Our copy constructor makes a **deep copy**: it allocates a new node for every node of `original`, in the same order."
msgstr "我们的拷贝构造函数进行**深拷贝**：它为 `original` 的每个节点按相同顺序分配一个新节点。"

msgid "**Line 2 to 5.** `cur_orig` walks through the original list. `prev_copy` points to the last node of the new list built so far. The new list starts empty."
msgstr "**第 2 到 5 行。** `cur_orig` 遍历原链表。`prev_copy` 指向目前已构建的新链表的最后一个节点。新链表一开始为空。"

msgid "**Line 7.** We allocate a copy of the current original node. For now, it is the last node of the new list, so its `next` is `nullptr`."
msgstr "**第 7 行。** 我们为当前的原节点分配一个副本。目前它是新链表的最后一个节点，所以它的 `next` 是 `nullptr`。"

msgid "**Line 8 to 12.** If this is the first copied node, `head` points to it. Otherwise, we append it after the last copied node."
msgstr "**第 8 到 12 行。** 如果这是第一个被复制的节点，`head` 指向它。否则，我们把它追加到最后一个已复制节点的后面。"

msgid "**Line 13 and 14.** We advance to the next original node, and the node we just copied becomes the last node of the new list."
msgstr "**第 13 和 14 行。** 我们前进到下一个原节点，刚复制的节点成为新链表的最后一个节点。"

msgid "If `original` is empty, `cur_orig` starts as `nullptr`, the loop is skipped, and the new list is empty."
msgstr "如果 `original` 为空，`cur_orig` 一开始就是 `nullptr`，循环被跳过，新链表为空。"

msgid "**Time complexity.** For an original list of $n$ nodes, we visit every node and allocate one copy of each, so the copy constructor is $O(n)$ in **both** the best case and the worst case: every node must be copied."
msgstr "**时间复杂度。** 对于有 $n$ 个节点的原链表，我们访问每个节点并为每个节点分配一个副本，所以拷贝构造函数在最好情况和最坏情况下**都**是 $O(n)$ 的：每个节点都必须被复制。"

msgid "Copy assignment operator"
msgstr "拷贝赋值运算符"

msgid "The copy assignment operator replaces the nodes of an **existing** list with a deep copy of another list. One way is to free the old nodes, and then repeat the code of the copy constructor:"
msgstr "拷贝赋值运算符用另一个链表的深拷贝替换一个**已存在的**链表的节点。一种方法是先释放旧节点，然后重复拷贝构造函数中的代码："

msgid "**Line 2 to 4.** As we discussed in the Objects with Pointers chapter, we must check for self-assignment, *e.g.* `a = a;`. Otherwise, line 5 would free the nodes of `original` before we copy them."
msgstr "**第 2 到 4 行。** 正如我们在“含指针的对象”一章中讨论的，我们必须检查自赋值，*例如* `a = a;`。否则，第 5 行会在复制之前就释放 `original` 的节点。"

msgid "**Line 22.** We return the destination by reference, so that assignments can be chained, *e.g.* `a = b = c;`."
msgstr "**第 22 行。** 我们以引用的方式返回目标对象，这样赋值就可以连写，*例如* `a = b = c;`。"

msgid "Repeating code is error-prone. Instead, we can let the copy constructor do the copying:"
msgstr "重复代码容易出错。我们可以改为让拷贝构造函数来完成复制："

msgid "**Line 5.** `new_list` is a local deep copy of `original`."
msgstr "**第 5 行。** `new_list` 是 `original` 的一个局部深拷贝。"

msgid "**Line 6 and 7.** We free our old nodes, and take over the nodes of `new_list`."
msgstr "**第 6 和 7 行。** 我们释放自己的旧节点，并接管 `new_list` 的节点。"

msgid "**Line 8.** `new_list` is a local object, so its destructor is called when the function returns, and it deletes the nodes that `new_list.head` points to. By setting `new_list.head` to `nullptr`, its destructor runs `delete nullptr;`, which does nothing."
msgstr "**第 8 行。** `new_list` 是一个局部对象，所以函数返回时会调用它的析构函数，删除 `new_list.head` 指向的节点。把 `new_list.head` 设为 `nullptr` 后，它的析构函数执行的是 `delete nullptr;`，什么也不做。"

msgid "**<span style=\"color:red\">Problem: What if we forget line 8?</span>** Then `head` and `new_list.head` point to the same nodes. When the function returns, the destructor of `new_list` deletes these nodes, so `head` becomes a **dangling pointer**. Any later use of the list is undefined behavior, and the nodes are deleted a second time when the list itself is destroyed."
msgstr "**<span style=\"color:red\">问题：如果忘了第 8 行会怎样？</span>** 那么 `head` 和 `new_list.head` 指向相同的节点。函数返回时，`new_list` 的析构函数会删除这些节点，所以 `head` 成为**悬空指针**。之后对这个链表的任何使用都是未定义行为，而且当链表本身被销毁时，这些节点会被删除第二次。"

msgid "**Time complexity.** Let $n$ be the number of nodes in `original`, and $m$ the number of old nodes in the destination. In the worst case, we copy $n$ nodes and delete $m$ nodes, so the copy assignment operator is $O(n + m)$. In the best case, *i.e.* self-assignment, the function returns immediately, so it is $O(1)$."
msgstr "**时间复杂度。** 设 $n$ 为 `original` 中的节点数，$m$ 为目标对象中旧节点的数量。在最坏情况下，我们复制 $n$ 个节点并删除 $m$ 个节点，所以拷贝赋值运算符是 $O(n + m)$ 的。在最好情况下，*即*自赋值时，函数立即返回，所以是 $O(1)$ 的。"

msgid "The Rule of Three for `OrderedList`"
msgstr "`OrderedList` 的三法则"

msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

msgid "Destructor"
msgstr "析构函数"

msgid "Release the nodes that the list owns"
msgstr "释放链表拥有的节点"

msgid "Build a new, independent list of nodes"
msgstr "构建一个新的、独立的节点链"

msgid "Replace the existing nodes with an independent copy"
msgstr "用一个独立的副本替换已有的节点"

msgid "Putting it all together"
msgstr "把所有部分组合起来"

msgid "The following program uses every member function of `OrderedList`. We added a member function `print` that prints the values in the list, so we can see its contents."
msgstr "下面的程序用到了 `OrderedList` 的每个成员函数。我们添加了一个打印链表中各个值的成员函数 `print`，以便查看它的内容。"

msgid "**Code** {{code_runner_header}}"
msgstr "**代码** {{code_runner_header}}"

msgid "**[Line 115 to 120]** We insert `3`, `1`, `4` and `1` in an arbitrary order, but the list always stays ordered. The second `1` is inserted before the first `1`."
msgstr "**[第 115 到 120 行]** 我们以任意顺序插入 `3`、`1`、`4` 和 `1`，但链表始终保持有序。第二个 `1` 被插入到第一个 `1` 的前面。"

msgid "**[Line 121]** `4` is in the list and `2` is not. `cout` prints `true` as `1` and `false` as `0`."
msgstr "**[第 121 行]** `4` 在链表中，`2` 不在。`cout` 把 `true` 打印为 `1`，把 `false` 打印为 `0`。"

msgid "**[Line 122 to 126]** `b` is a deep copy of `a`, so deleting the first `1` from `b` does not change `a`. Deleting `5` returns `false`, since `5` is not in `b`."
msgstr "**[第 122 到 126 行]** `b` 是 `a` 的深拷贝，所以从 `b` 中删除第一个 `1` 不会改变 `a`。删除 `5` 返回 `false`，因为 `5` 不在 `b` 中。"

msgid "**[Line 127 and 128]** `a = b;` replaces the nodes of `a` with a copy of the nodes of `b`. `a = a;` is a self-assignment, so it does nothing."
msgstr "**[第 127 和 128 行]** `a = b;` 用 `b` 的节点的副本替换 `a` 的节点。`a = a;` 是自赋值，所以什么也不做。"

msgid "**[Line 131]** When `a` and `b` go out of scope, their destructors free their own nodes. Since each list owns separate nodes, no node is deleted twice."
msgstr "**[第 131 行]** 当 `a` 和 `b` 离开作用域时，它们的析构函数各自释放自己的节点。由于每个链表拥有各自独立的节点，没有节点会被删除两次。"

msgid "**Output**"
msgstr "**输出**"

msgid "Time complexity"
msgstr "时间复杂度"

msgid "Let $n$ be the number of nodes in the list. For the copy assignment operator, the source list has $n$ nodes and the destination list has $m$ old nodes."
msgstr "设 $n$ 为链表中的节点数。对于拷贝赋值运算符，源链表有 $n$ 个节点，目标链表有 $m$ 个旧节点。"

msgid "Best case"
msgstr "最好情况"

msgid "Worst case"
msgstr "最坏情况"

msgid "Search (`dataExists`)"
msgstr "查找（`dataExists`）"

msgid "$O(1)$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$O(n)$"
msgstr ""

msgid "Insert in order (`insertData`)"
msgstr "按序插入（`insertData`）"

msgid "Delete by value (`deleteData`)"
msgstr "按值删除（`deleteData`）"

msgid "$O(n + m)$"
msgstr ""

msgid "Unlike `push`, `pop`, `enqueue` and `dequeue`, which only work at the ends of a list, searching, inserting and deleting in an ordered list may need to walk through the whole list to find the right position."
msgstr "`push`、`pop`、`enqueue` 和 `dequeue` 只在链表的两端操作；与它们不同，在有序链表中查找、插入和删除可能需要遍历整个链表才能找到正确的位置。"

msgid "Summary"
msgstr "小结"

msgid "In this chapter, we have learned:"
msgstr "在本章中，我们学习了："

msgid "a linked list is a collection of dynamically allocated nodes linked by pointers, which can grow and shrink without copying elements,"
msgstr "链表是由指针连接起来的一组动态分配的节点，它可以增长和收缩而不需要复制元素，"

msgid "the destructor of a node can delete the rest of the list, so we must detach a node before deleting it on its own,"
msgstr "节点的析构函数可能会删除链表的其余部分，所以在单独删除一个节点之前必须先把它分离出来，"

msgid "a stack inserts and removes at the head (LIFO), and a queue inserts at the tail and removes at the head (FIFO),"
msgstr "栈在头部插入和删除（LIFO），而队列在尾部插入、在头部删除（FIFO），"

msgid "an ordered linked list keeps its values sorted, and finds the position to insert or delete a node by walking through the list with a `previous` and a `current` pointer,"
msgstr "有序链表让它的值保持有序，并通过 `previous` 和 `current` 两个指针遍历链表，找到插入或删除节点的位置，"

msgid "a linked list does not support random access, so binary search does not help on a linked list,"
msgstr "链表不支持随机访问，所以二分查找对链表没有帮助，"

msgid "a class that owns the nodes of a linked list needs a destructor, a copy constructor and a copy assignment operator that make deep copies (the Rule of Three),"
msgstr "拥有链表节点的类需要析构函数，以及进行深拷贝的拷贝构造函数和拷贝赋值运算符（三法则），"

msgid "to always think of the special cases: an empty list, a list with only one node, and changes at the head or the tail of the list, and"
msgstr "要始终考虑特殊情况：空链表、只有一个节点的链表，以及在链表头部或尾部的修改，以及"

msgid "`push`, `pop`, `enqueue` and `dequeue` are $O(1)$, searching, inserting and deleting in an ordered list are $O(n)$ in the worst case, and destroying or copying a list of $n$ nodes is $O(n)$."
msgstr "`push`、`pop`、`enqueue` 和 `dequeue` 都是 $O(1)$ 的，在有序链表中查找、插入和删除在最坏情况下是 $O(n)$ 的，而销毁或复制一个有 $n$ 个节点的链表是 $O(n)$ 的。"

